        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST- VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST**\n*** BEAUTIFUL 4 BEDROOM HOUSE *** FULLY FURNISHED THROUGHOUT *** LARGE FRONT & REAR GARDENS *** SUPER LOCATION *** AVAILABLE NOW!!\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS proudly present this superb four-bedroom, three-bathroom property with a beautiful large rear garden to the rental market in the ever-popular and mature development of Tamarisk View, Tallaght, Dublin 24.\nIdeally located in a highly sought-after residential area, this fantastic home benefits from a wealth of amenities right on your doorstep along with excellent transport connections. Bright and spacious living accommodation comprises of an inviting entrance hallway, generous lounge, separate dining area, fully fitted kitchen, rear conservatory, four well-proportioned bedrooms and three bathrooms.\nThe property is presented in excellent condition throughout and boasts a large private back garden, perfect for outdoor living and entertaining. To the front, there is private parking within the front garden, offering convenient off-street parking.\nTamarisk View enjoys a prime Tallaght location with The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Village, Tymon Park, shops, cafés, gyms and leisure facilities all easily accessible. The area is very well serviced by public transport including the LUAS Red Line and numerous Dublin Bus routes, providing seamless access to the City Centre and surrounding areas. The N81 and M50 road networks are also easily reached. - Viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAdditional Features:\n-4 Bed / 3 Bath\n-Rear conservatory\n-Large private back garden\n-Parking in front garden\n-Bright and spacious living accommodation\n-Excellent condition throughout\n-Mature and highly desirable location\n-Fantastic public transport links nearby\n-Easy access to LUAS, Dublin Bus, N81 & M50\nAVAILABLE NOW\n**RAY COOKE LETTINGS - EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE- FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE - WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE**\n"
